WEBVTT

NOTE Source-grounded narration; diagrams are editorial, not source data.

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.328
On the proposal, the final structure was an

00:00:05.328 --> 00:00:07.550
imidazopyridine. The

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:13.425
scheme had a destination before we had made the

00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:14.550
molecule.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:19.158
Our team proposed two synthetic routes toward

00:00:19.158 --> 00:00:22.767
substituted imidazopyridines, with structural

00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:24.050
characterization

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.796
to come before biological evaluation. That was the

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:32.550
plan in 2018.

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:39.502
By the final report, we could not claim the intended

00:00:39.502 --> 00:00:43.050
heterocycles. The proposed ring

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:49.157
closure had not delivered those compounds. Whatever we

00:00:49.157 --> 00:00:52.550
wrote next had to begin there.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.930
We did isolate and characterize three imines, also

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:02.050
called Schiff bases. They had

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:07.648
entered the project as intermediates, not the endpoint

00:01:07.648 --> 00:01:10.550
we were originally pursuing.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:16.297
Instead of treating those compounds only as unfinished

00:01:16.297 --> 00:01:19.550
starting materials, we examined their

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:24.134
response to anions. Cyanide produced a particularly

00:01:24.134 --> 00:01:27.550
visible change in one sensor solution.

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:33.501
Under the reported test conditions, a yellow solution

00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:37.050
turned orange after cyanide was added.

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:42.350
A colour change was observable. Its meaning still had

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:45.550
to be checked spectroscopically.

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:51.902
The band near 380 nanometres declined as a new band

00:01:51.902 --> 00:01:55.050
near 450 grew. The report gave

00:01:55.050 --> 00:02:01.057
a detection limit of 1.42 times ten to the minus five

00:02:01.057 --> 00:02:03.550
molar for that sensor.

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:09.000
Colleagues explored two compounds, CMP5 and CMPB, in

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.937
triple-negative breast-cancer cell lines. Some

00:02:12.937 --> 00:02:14.050
proliferation

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:19.658
and migration readouts differed, but that was not

00:02:19.658 --> 00:02:23.550
evidence of a validated treatment.

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:30.925
Some c-MYC measurements rose where we had expected the

00:02:30.925 --> 00:02:33.050
opposite, and some

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:38.288
comparisons were not significant. Direct PRMT5 target

00:02:38.288 --> 00:02:41.550
engagement was never established.

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:45.794
COVID restrictions interrupted later protein-level

00:02:45.794 --> 00:02:49.103
follow-up. Our final report contained characterized

00:02:49.103 --> 00:02:51.050
imines, chemical observations,

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:56.107
and unfinished biological questions. It did not

00:02:56.107 --> 00:02:59.550
contain the ring we had planned.
